Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,

An account has been created for you<%= " at #{@company_name}" if @company_name.present? %> on the HR portal. Here are your sign-in details.

  Email:    <%= @user.email_address %>
  Password: <%= @password %>

Sign in here: <%= @sign_in_url %>

<% if @must_change -%>
This password works once. You will be asked to choose your own as soon as you sign in.
<% else -%>
You can keep using this password. If you would rather pick your own, you can change it at any time from Settings once you are signed in.
<% end -%>

Because this password arrived by email, treat it as known to anyone who can read this mailbox. If you weren't expecting this, tell your administrator — they can issue a new one, which stops this password working immediately.
